Z||000012||87ECO5||06-14-2000||04:30 PM||||hmmmmmmmm.....ZR-1 Fiero....hmmmmmmmmmmmm<P>I'm with WKDFIRO!  A 32-valve monster of a powerplant designed by Lotus and Chevy and built by Mercury Marine!  Available only as part of the ZR-1 package from 1990 to 1995.  1990-1992 models produced 375 horsepower.  1993-1995 models produced 405 horsepower.<P>Question - would anyone install the valet key switch!?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   I know I'd have to.  FieroWife thinks she's Sarah Fisher!!!!!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000013||DJRice||06-15-2000||09:07 AM||||hmmmmmmmm.....ZR-1 Fiero....hmmmmmmmmmmmm<P>It seems to me that one might accidentally peel the skin off of their skull when you drop the hammer with 400HP strapped to a Fiero.  The FAA may limit ZR-1 Fieros to fighter pilots only...., or civilians willing to pay for a class at Top Gun.||||reg||1
